```
**Analysis:**
- The error here suggests that the title is "Trip Input" and not "Input Trip Details". This mismatch is what leads to the failure.
- The expectation in the test case should match the actual title rendered in the template.

**Solution:**
- Update the expectation in the test case:
```python
